<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,086 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 1,086 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 1,086 contracts compared with 1,634 overnight Sunday.</p>
<p>There were 119 wheat, 422 corn, 471 soybean, 25 soymeal, 25 soyoil, two oat, two wheat puts and 20 corn calls traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was fractionally mixed, corn was steady to one cent higher and soybeans were 3/4 to five cents higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
